    "how": "<code>svix-signature: v1,&lt;base64&gt;</code>, the HMAC-SHA256 of <code>&quot;&lt;svix-id&gt;.&lt;svix-timestamp&gt;.&lt;body&gt;&quot;</code>, keyed with the base64 part of the <code>whsec_</code> secret. Standard Webhooks senders use <code>webhook-*</code> header names.",
